for 3 kg boneless pork shoulder blade

cut in pieces to fit in the slow cooker 

crush
 - 2 tsp whole peppercorn 

stir in
 - 1 tbsp oregano 
 - 1 tbsp basil
 - 2 tsp table salt
 - 1 tsp granulated garlic
 - 1/2 tsp crushed pepper

cover meat with spice mix

place in slow cooker 
 - 2 thinly sliced large onions
 - 1 peeled garlic bulb
 - 1/2 cup red wine
 - 4 bay leaves 

add meat
cook on high until liquid is bubbly
reduce to low
cook about 7 hours
aim for 205F internal 

cook per sandwich
 - 150-200 g broccolini or spinach 

strain sauce in a pan 
remove fat
reduce to 1/2 cup

pull pork 
add sauce

